      "pot": {
        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables name and value\n    purchase_price = 89.4535\n    par_value = 100\n    annual_coupon_rate = 0.06\n    reinvestment_rate = 0.085\n    holding_period_years = 4\n    remaining_years_at_sale = 1\n\n    # Do math calculation to get the answer\n    annual_coupon = par_value * annual_coupon_rate\n\n    future_value_of_coupons = sum(\n        annual_coupon * (1 + reinvestment_rate) ** periods\n        for periods in range(holding_period_years)\n    )\n\n    sale_price = (par_value + annual_coupon) / (\n        (1 + reinvestment_rate) ** remaining_years_at_sale\n    )\n\n    ending_value = future_value_of_coupons + sale_price\n    realized_yield = (ending_value / purchase_price) ** (\n        1 / holding_period_years\n    ) - 1\n\n    # return answer\n    return round(realized_yield * 100, 2)\n```",
